    * X, Z, U, V, &amp; W are linear (Y cannot be used),
    * A, B, &amp; C are angular (rotary), and
    * Sp0 and Sp1 are spindles and can use any plug, but Sp1 needs Sp0 (its speed is set as a percentage of Sp0's).

Changing an assignment will probably require you to move the actual motor cable to match the assignment.</property>
